Outside on the street, it is very cold.
January in Berlin is freezing.
I walk into the office.
It is nice and warm in here.
I take off my jacket.
I stand here and look around.
I think for a moment.
I am thirty-one years old.
I am far away from Mexico.
I am in a new country now.
And today I start a new job.
I work here as a software engineer.
The office is big and bright.
I see many tables and laptops.
I have a lot of questions, of course.
I am a little nervous on my first day.
But I am looking forward to the work.
My new life here begins.
